# Chasing Her — Environment Variables
#
# Good news: No API keys or secrets are required to run or deploy this app.
# Firebase (Firestore + Storage) is already configured in `firebase-applet-config.json`.
#
# Optional build/hosting variables (all have safe defaults):

# VITE_BASE_PATH: Base URL path for static hosting (defaults to "/").
# GitHub Pages sets this automatically in `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`.
# For a custom domain or local development, leave as "/".
VITE_BASE_PATH="/"

# NODE_ENV: Set to "production" in production builds (set automatically by hosting/CI).
NODE_ENV="development"
